[•] - Storyline-Sem :
AKT1 The Beginning of the Apocalypse
STOR01 Sem: Who the hell is calling?
STOR02 Sem: Am I even listening?
STOR03 Thomas: Sam, its me, your brother Thomas. Are you still sleeping? You promised to come early.
STOR04 Sem: Yeah, sorry.
STOR05 Thomas: Okay, it happens. Just get ready quickly and come to me, little brother.
STOR06 Thomas: Alright.
STOR07 Sem: I ll find the car myself.
STOR08 Sem: Now I have to go to Thomas, I m already late.
STOR09 Get in the car.
STOR012 Sem: Damn, we need to get out of here. What kind of creature is this?

AKT2 Zombie Day
STOR013 Sem: My head hurts.
STOR014 Sam: Hey, what are you doing?!
STOR015 Sam: What the hell is this thing?!
STOR016 Sem: We need to get back home. It s not safe outside; crazy people are everywhere.

AKT3 28 Days Later
STOR017 Sem: Damn, I m running out of food. I ll have to go get some.
STOR018 Sem: We need to grab the shotgun from the second floor.
STOR20 Sem: Now we need to go outside to finish collecting food.
STOR21 Sem: We need to get a bit more food.
STOR22 Sem: What the…?!
STOR23 Sem: Phew… its gone for now. Let s head back home.

AKT4 Survivor Rescue
STOR24 Sem: What the hell are these people?!
STOR25 Sem: We need to help that girl. These guys look like bandits.
STOR26 Bandit: What kind of weirdo… kill him, the fuck!
STOR026 Selina: Thank you for your help, kind man. If it weren t for you, they would ve killed me… or worse.
STOR27 Sem: Don t mention it. I m glad I found a living person myself.
STOR28 Selina: By the way, my name is Selina. And you?
STOR29 Sem: Just call me Sem.
STOR30 Selina: Great, nice to meet you.
STOR31 Sem: I need to leave here. My house is nearby, but I have a plan to get out of the city. Let s go.
STOR32 Selina: Great idea, let s get out of here.

AKT5 For Medicines
STOR33 Sem: Remember I said I have a plan to get out of town?
STOR34 Selina: Of course. Why?
STOR35 Sem: We need supplies medicine and gasoline. We have plenty of food.
STOR36 Selina: Hmm, sure. Otherwise, the infected will find us sooner or later.
STOR37 Sem: You re right.
STOR38 Sem: Let s get going for the first task — medicine. You never know what might happen on the road.
STOR39 Selina: Let s go.
STOR040 Selina: I ll pick the lock. You protect me; these creatures are wandering nearby.

AKT6 Burger Tank
STOR41 Sem: Hi, ready to start the second task?
STOR42 Selina: Yes, I m ready. Shall we go?
STOR43 Sem: Cool. Finish this task, then we can leave town.
STOR44 Sem: Alright, let s go.
STOR45 Sem: TAAAAAAANK!

AKT7 Escape from the State
STOR47 Sem: Hi, now we have to get out of town.
STOR48 Selina: Yes, I'm ready. And you?
STOR49 Sem: I was born ready.
STOR50 Selina: Cool, let's go.
STOR51 Bandit: Not so fast! We thought we forgot about you. Kill these bastards, but leave the girl.
STOR52 Sem: Let's all go.
STOR53 Selina: Damn the helicopter.
STOR54 Sem: We broke away for now.

AKT8 Meeting with a New Survivor
STOR55 Selina: Well, what about our car?
STOR56 Sem: So far, it s fine.
STOR57 Selina: How can you tell it s okay?
STOR58 Sem: Everything seems fine, let's go.
STOR59 Selina: Wow, so fast.
STOR058 Unknown: Hey, help!
STOR059 Sem: Let's help him, man.
STOR60 Selina: Of course, let's go, but damn, there are a lot of these creatures.
STOR61 Selina: Damn, those things again.
STOR62 Sem: There's a thug at the door!
STOR63 Unknown: Hi, thanks for the help. Without you, I would have been devoured by these creatures.
STOR64 Sem: Don t be grateful.
STOR65 Oliver: By the way, my name is Oliver. Glad to meet you.
STOR66 Sem: Us too.
STOR67 Selina: We re glad to meet a living person as well.
STOR68 Oliver: So, what s next?
STOR69 Sem: Next, we plan to walk to Las Vegas and then call a lifeguard from there, but first, we need to pick up my brother in Los Santos.
STOR70 Oliver: I m with you then.

AKT9 Meeting with a Witch
STOR71 Oliver: What should we do?
STOR72 Sem: You two collect gasoline, and I ll eat — there are snack bars nearby.
STOR73 Oliver: Got it, we ll do that.
STOR74 Selina: Let s do it, boss.
STOR75 Oliver: Replacing Selina.
STOR76 Sem: That s great, but you need to collect two more boxes of food.
STOR77 Sem: One more to go, then we re done.
STOR78 Sem: Damn, there s some kind of witch here. I saw a creature like this before the apocalypse began.
STOR79 Sem: That s it. You can return to the shelter now.

AKT10 Saving a Brother
STOR80 Sem: Are we ready to save my brother?
STOR81 Oliver: Let s get out of here.
STOR82 Sem: You wait here, I ll go myself.
STOR83 Sem: Thomas, where are you, brother?!
STOR84 Sem: Oh no, Thomas!!!
STOR85 Selina: I m sorry about your brother. We heard from here, very unfortunate.
STOR86 Sem: Let s stay safe for a while, and I ll help my brother.
STOR87 Oliver: Of course. That s the right thing to do, it s a pity about your brother.

AKT11 Ambush
STOR88 Sem: Where the hell is everyone?!
STOR89 Selina: Thanks, Sem, you saved us again.
STOR90 Ben: Hi buddy, thanks for the help. They grabbed me while I was wandering.
STOR91 Sem: It s okay, buddy.
STOR92 Oliver: These assholes grabbed us while we were sleeping.
STOR93 Ben: Can I come with you?
STOR94 Sem: Of course, we could use an extra hand.
STOR95 Oliver: Yeah, let s get out of here before they devour us.

AKT12 Escape
STOR96 Sem: Well, are we ready, boys?
STOR97 Oliver: Yes, of course. We re heading to Las Vegas; the casino will earn us money.
STOR98 Ben: I m ready, let s go.
STOR99 Sem: Damn, a military helicopter.
STOR100 Ben: Everything flashed by, I thought we were done for.
STOR101 Oliver: I thought the same. They re not bandits; they re suckers.

AKT13 Military Attack
STOR102 Selina: We need a walkie-talkie to call the lifeguard.
STOR103 Ben: Where are we going to get it?
STOR104 Sem: You re right. There s a police station nearby; there s definitely a walkie-talkie.
STOR105 Oliver: Let s go then. Who are we waiting for?!
STO103 Oliver: Damn, it s the military. Looks like they found us.
STOR107 Ben: Reinforcements are coming.
STOR108 Oliver: Yes, we re fine.
STOR109 Selina: Of course, we re fine.

AKT14 Last Chance
STOR110 Sem: This is our last chance. We can t delay anymore; we re already behind.
STOR111 Ben: You re right. Let s go?
STOR112 Oliver: I hope no one attacks us this time.
STOR113 Sem: Stay in the car, I ll go myself. Seems faster this way.
STOR114 Sem: Oh damn, so many creatures here. We ll have to fight them all to move forward.
STOR115 Sem: I got the walkie-talkie. Now we have to get out of here.
STOR116 Sem: Oh my God, the Tank… we ll have to deal with him again.
STOR117 Selina: Did you get the walkie-talkie?
STOR118 Oliver: Finally, we can leave this hell.
STOR119 Sem: Yes, let s go to the shelter. We need to prepare; you never know what will happen during the rescue call.

AKT15 Final: Escape from the State
STOR120 Oliver: We re finally getting out of hell.
STOR121 Selina: Yes, finally, no need to stay on alert constantly.
STOR122 Ben: I m glad I met you.
STOR123 Sem: Looks like everyone s ready. Let s go.
STO300 Rescuer: Name your location?!
STO301 Sem: We re in the State of Las Vegas, 4 people on the roof near the police station.
STOR302 Lifeguard: OK, we ll arrive. Wait at the rescue point.
STOR123 Oliver: Damn, these creatures from the roof are attacking while defending themselves.
STOR124 Sem: Thank God we escaped this crazy state.
STOR125 You have completed the storyline. Congratulations!
